cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Bad Actors, its games or its standings in your work, please cite it like this."
title: "Bad Actors"
abstract: >-
  Frontier AI models play a hidden-role murder game in a simulated castle. A
  deterministic referee records every act, observation and statement, so each
  claim a model makes can be checked against what actually happened and against
  what the speaker could have known.
type: software
authors:
